 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Not at all. Some places still serve fresh coffee, so it might still be hot. Just ask the waiter to bring it right over, so it' hot when it arrives. That's doable. Each person puts in a bit of change from their pockets, and signs a shared note. Then one person buys it in coin from an ATM. Split it evenly by the number of people, then rounds up to the next pound. That way, nobody's short changed. You' welcome. Coffee's the ultimate excuse for a shared treat, so go for it.",
